      "hash": "blake3:normalized-context-pack-hash",
      "text": "# Context Pack: format before release\n\n**Profile:** compact | **Budget:** 8/4000 tokens\n\n## Advisory Memory Banner\n\n**Status:** `degraded`\n\nContext includes 4 degraded signals; semantic embedding is unavailable, so treat retrieval ranking as lexical-only until a semantic model is available.\n\n## procedural_rules\n\n### 1. mem_00000000000000000000000001 (8 tokens)\n\n```\nRun cargo fmt --check before release.\n```\n\n**Why:** matched 'format before release' via lexical (relevance 0.5754, utility 0.8000)\n\n**Trust:** `human_explicit` / `authoritative`\n\n**Provenance:**\n- `file://AGENTS.md#L164-173` (file)\n\n## Degradations\n\n- **[warning]** Embedding model unavailable (active embedder source frankensearch_hash_fallback reports semantic=false); semantic similarity is disabled and lexical search remains available.\n  - *Repair:* `ee index reembed --workspace .`\n- **[low]** Memory mem_00000000000000000000000001 evidence freshness is missing_source: Referenced provenance file \\[REDACTED_PATH\\] is missing.\n  - *Repair:* `Restore the file or revise the memory provenance URI; rebuild the index if the memory content changes.`\n- **[low]** output.explain was accepted; JSON context packs already include algorithm metadata, the selection audit, and per-item why explanations.\n  - *Repair:* `Inspect data.pack.meta.algorithm, data.pack.selectionAudit, and data.pack.items[].why.`\n- **[low]** Search rerank is in auto mode, but the local reranker is unavailable; returning fusion-only ranking. No reranker model is registered, and no cached default reranker artifact was found to auto-provision.\n  - *Repair:* `ee model fetch rerank-default --from-file /path/to/rerank-default-v1.tar.zst`\n\n---\n\n*Generated by `ee pack \"format before release\" --format markdown`*\n\n<!-- pack.hash: normalized-context-pack-hash -->\n<!-- pack.schema: ee.response.v2 -->\n",
